00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,445
Its advantages: seventy to seventy five percent efficiency, against about forty percent for a thermal power station, because the energy never has to become heat first.

2
00:00:11,445 --> 00:00:15,364
No smoke, no oxides of nitrogen or sulphur.

3
00:00:15,364 --> 00:00:22,565
Its drawbacks: expensive platinum catalysts, and hydrogen that is hard to store and transport safely.

